  "plain": "A podcast host named Jesse Michels, talking in 2024 with a guest named Ryan Graves, says that AARO, a Pentagon office set up to look into reports of unidentified objects in the sky, had just changed leaders. According to Michels, the office passed from a director named Kirkpatrick to a new head, a man named Kosloski, whose name Graves had told him. He raises it because a change at the top could change how the government handles UFO reports."
